  // dummy test to trigger the listener
  ASSERT_TRUE(true);
}
```

### Conclusion

The proposed implementation provides a new `CustomTestListener` that captures key events throughout the lifecycle of the testing process. It adds a layer of observability to the unit testing framework which can be useful for debugging and reporting purposes. Make sure to run and validate these changes to ensure they integrate well with the existing Google Test framework.

